 "وَمَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَنۢبَغِى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَمَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَسْتَطِيعُونَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/181a9605117053d16198.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "mogu", "en": "they are able", "tr": "güç yetirebilirler", "fr": "ils sont capables", "id": "mereka mampu", "ur": "وہ استطاعت رکھتے ہیں", "bn": "তারা সক্ষম", "fa": "می‌توانند"}}]}, {"ref": "18:67", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/2207.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "He said: Lo! thou canst not bear with me.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "(Hızır) dedi ki: \"Doğrusu sen benimle asla sabredemezsin.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "کہا آپ میرے ساتھ ہرگز نہ ٹھہر سکیں گے", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dia menjawab: \"Sesungguhnya kamu sekali-kali tidak akan sanggup sabar bersama aku.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "قَالَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِنَّكَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تَسْتَطِيعَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/330f95ce0a8a65db90c5.m4a", "gloss": null, "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "subjunctive"}]}, {"text": "مَعِىَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "صَبْرًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "51:45", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/4720.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And they w